{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29773","headline":"赋得月照冰池 · 李商隐","name":"赋得月照冰池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皓月方离海，坚冰正满池。\n金波双激射，璧彩两参差。\n影占徘徊处，光含的皪时。\n高低连素色，上下接清规。\n顾兔飞难定，潜鱼跃未期。\n鹊惊俱欲遶，狐听始无疑。\n似镜将盈手，如霜恐透肌。\n独怜游翫意，达晓不知疲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}